{"t": 1794109531.5569417, "kind": "call", "tool": "slack_post_message", "args": {"channel_id": "C07INCID003", "text": "reports-api 502s \u2014 root cause found. CloudWatch `/ecs/reports-api` shows `ERROR export failed: ValueError: dict contains fields not in fieldnames: 'currency'` right after `upstream ledger 2026.11 added currency to every row`. reports/export.py hard-coded CSV columns to id,amount, so every export request raised on the new field. Fix: added `currency` to the export fieldnames (CSV is now id,amount,currency; rows without it still export). Needs deploy to take effect."}, "ok": true}
